<title>USA: Richfield, Minn., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Richfield, Minn., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $5.075 million of Richfield, Minn., general obligation taxable tax increment bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 6.84 percent.</p>
